        <mxCell id="t2H5Lw-tumbk8teAm2dc-10" value="&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); line-height: 150%;&quot;&gt;@file: rag/index/base.py&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;@desc: 调用逻辑如标题，基本只是嵌套调用，无特殊逻辑，此处只解析&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;aload_document_with_limit 功能&lt;div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;   1. 分组加载 chunks（按照 &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;max_chunks_once_load 为一组&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space-collapse: preserve; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;）；&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space-collapse: preserve; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;    2. 每组创建一个 aload_document 异步任务；&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space-collapse: preserve; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;    3. 输出成功提示；&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=1;points=[];autosize=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontFamily=Comic Sans MS;container=0;movable=1;rotatable=1;deletable=1;editable=1;locked=0;connectable=1;" vertex="1" parent="t2H5Lw-tumbk8teAm2dc-9">
