        <mxCell id="t2H5Lw-tumbk8teAm2dc-16" value="&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); line-height: 150%;&quot;&gt;@file: storage/vector_store/chroma_store.py&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;@desc:&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;    1. 遍历 chunks 获取文本内容, 将 metadatas 转换适合 chroma&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;    2. 调用 _add_texts  将当前组的文本一次性 embedding&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=1;points=[];autosize=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontFamily=Comic Sans MS;container=0;movable=1;rotatable=1;deletable=1;editable=1;locked=0;connectable=1;" vertex="1" parent="t2H5Lw-tumbk8teAm2dc-15">
